  "details": "Description\n\nThere is a bug where, when you open the radial menu and select an item, a single click is recognized as a double-click even though you only clicked once.\n\nReproduction Steps\n\nThere is no specific way to reproduce this issue. There is also no way to prevent it. It occurs unexpectedly, and the only option is to wait for it to resolve on its own.\n\nDetails\n\n- Category: ユーザーインターフェース\n\n- Frequency: しばしば\n\n---\n\nplatform: PC (platform: Windows, store: Steam, headset: None)\n\nrawPlatform: WindowsPlayer\n\nclientVersion: 2026.3.3-1919-27c41b24d2-Release\n\nunityVersion: 6000.0.67f1-DWR\n\nIn-Client Report\n\n---\n\n**Log file:** [output_log_2026-10-04_01-25-35.txt](https://api.vrchat.cloud/api/1/file/file_1e48d14b-3868-41fa-b536-f4187b9f521c/1/file)",
